{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53068","headline":"句 四 · 郎士元","name":"句 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马令无茶分。\n（见刘克庄《後村大全集》卷一八四《诗话新集》）（〖1〗刘克庄云：「余记唐人杂书载士元尝对客有『马令无茶分』之戏。\n北平王一日饮客，士元与焉。\n坐间，北平醉饱设茗供，连沃数碗，士元老不能禁，即席吐利交下。\n满坐大笑。\n今不省出处，当考。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}